<title>UK: SOCCER-SCOTLAND 1 SWEDEN 0 LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTLAND 1 SWEDEN 0 LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scotland led Sweden 1-0 in their World Cup European group four qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: John McGinlay 8.</p>
